{"articleNo":"419935","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=419935&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[부속기관] 2022학년도 독서인증제 마감일 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.12.13","hit":"5043","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">2022학년도 독서인증제 운영 마감일을 다음과 같이 안내하오니,&nbsp;기한 내에 신청 및 평가해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">1.&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">(</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">학&nbsp;부 생</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">)</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">&nbsp;독서인증제 신청 마감&nbsp;:&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">2023. 1. 16.(</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">월</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">)</span></strong></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">2.&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">(</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">지도교수</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">)</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">&nbsp;독서인증제 평가 마감&nbsp;:&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">2023. 1.20.(금</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">)</span></strong></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">3.&nbsp;마감 이후는 업무처리가 중지되오니&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">기한일</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">을&nbsp;</span><str